{"seq":3,"slug":"water-vapor-and-clouds","title":"水汽、饱和与云的形成","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science/atmosphere-composition-thermodynamics/water-vapor-and-clouds","wordCount":1347,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"水汽-饱和与云的形成\">水汽、饱和与云的形成</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>下过雨的清晨，看着山腰那条横着的云带，我曾经以为云就是&quot;飘在天上的水&quot;。后来才明白，云的形成是一个相当精确的物理过程：空气得先把水汽&quot;装满&quot;，再被抬升降温到装不下，多出来的水汽才会凝结成可见的水滴。这一节抓住：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>饱和、饱和水汽压、相对湿度、露点的含义；</li>\n<li>水汽凝结时释放的潜热，以及它为何能改变气块的降温速率；</li>\n<li>湿绝热递减率，以及云为什么大多出现在空气被抬升的地方。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>核心概念：饱和水汽压、相对湿度、露点、潜热、抬升凝结高度、湿绝热递减率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"空气能-装-多少水\">空气能&quot;装&quot;多少水</h3><p>一定温度下，空气能容纳的水汽有上限，对应的水汽分压叫<strong>饱和水汽压</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。关键规律是：温度越高，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越大，空气能装的水汽越多。这条关系由克劳修斯–克拉佩龙方程描述，可近似写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∝</mo><mi>exp</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>v</mi></msub><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>T</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_s(T) \\propto \\exp\\!\\left( \\frac{L_v}{R_v} \\cdot \\frac{T - T_0}{T \\, T_0} \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">exp</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是水的汽化潜热，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>v</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是水汽的气体常数。你不必记住系数，记住&quot;暖空气能装更多水&quot;这个结论就够用——这也是为什么夏天闷热时空气里水汽含量远高于冬天。</p>\n<p>由此引出几个日常量：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>相对湿度</strong>：实际水汽压与饱和水汽压之比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e / e_s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，达到 100% 即饱和。</li>\n<li><strong>露点</strong>：把空气冷却到刚好饱和时的温度。露点离当前气温越近，说明空气越潮、越接近成云成雾。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"凝结放热-隐藏的燃料\">凝结放热：隐藏的燃料</h3><p>水从气态变成液态时，会释放出<strong>潜热</strong>。这是大气里一个极重要的能量来源。前一节讲干空气上升按 9.8 K/km 降温；可一旦上升到饱和、开始凝结，凝结释放的潜热会&quot;加热&quot;气块，使它的降温速率变慢。</p>\n<p>这个变慢后的速率叫<strong>湿绝热递减率</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，它不是常数，通常在 4–7 K/km 之间，越暖越湿的空气数值越小（因为凝结放热越多）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;  A[&quot;近地面湿空气被抬升&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;按干绝热降温 ~9.8 K/km&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C{&quot;是否到达露点 / 饱和?&quot;}&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;未饱和&quot;| B&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;饱和&quot;| D[&quot;抬升凝结高度&lt;br/&gt;云底出现&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;继续上升&lt;br/&gt;按湿绝热 4-7 K/km 降温&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;凝结放潜热&lt;br/&gt;支撑气块继续上浮&quot;]\">flowchart TB\n  A[\"近地面湿空气被抬升\"] --&gt; B[\"按干绝热降温 ~9.8 K/km\"]\n  B --&gt; C{\"是否到达露点 / 饱和?\"}\n  C --&gt;|\"未饱和\"| B\n  C --&gt;|\"饱和\"| D[\"抬升凝结高度&lt;br/&gt;云底出现\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"继续上升&lt;br/&gt;按湿绝热 4-7 K/km 降温\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"凝结放潜热&lt;br/&gt;支撑气块继续上浮\"]</pre><p>正是这股潜热，让雷暴和台风拥有了惊人的能量：它们本质上是大量水汽凝结、把潜热源源不断释放出来的&quot;热机&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"云为什么大多在抬升处出现\">云为什么大多在抬升处出现</h3><p>把上面的链条串起来：一团湿空气要成云，最常见的路径是被抬升——降温——达到饱和——凝结。它从地面上升到刚好饱和的那个高度，叫<strong>抬升凝结高度</strong>，大致就是平坦积云云底的高度。这解释了几个常见现象：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>抬升机制</th>\n<th>典型云/天气</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>地面受热产生对流上升</td>\n<td>晴天午后的积云、雷暴</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>气流被迫翻越山脉（地形抬升）</td>\n<td>迎风坡多云多雨</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暖空气沿锋面爬升</td>\n<td>锋面云系、连绵降水</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低压区辐合上升</td>\n<td>大范围阴雨</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>反过来，下沉的空气会绝热增温、相对湿度下降，所以高压控制、空气下沉的地方往往晴朗少云。&quot;晴天高压、阴雨低压&quot;的经验规律，根子就在这里。</p>\n<h3 id=\"从云滴到降水\">从云滴到降水</h3><p>空气饱和只是第一步。水汽要凝结，还需要<strong>凝结核</strong>——微小的尘埃、盐粒等。无数云滴形成后，还得通过碰并增长或冰晶过程长大到足够重，才能克服上升气流落下来变成雨雪。这一步的效率，决定了同样一片云是只飘着还是真的下雨。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>为什么夏天的雷暴往往比冬天的降水更剧烈？请从&quot;暖空气含水量&quot;和&quot;潜热&quot;两个角度回答。</li>\n<li>某地气温 25 ℃、露点 24 ℃，说明空气接近什么状态？当晚容易出现什么现象？</li>\n<li>解释为什么山的迎风坡多雨、背风坡却常常干燥（提示：结合本节的抬升凝结与上一节的下沉增温）。</li>\n<li>湿绝热递减率为什么不是常数，而干绝热递减率却是常数？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>雾与云本质相同，区别只在于是否贴地。研究辐射雾的形成，是理解露点与饱和的好练习。</li>\n<li>人工增雨通过播撒凝结核/冰核来提高降水效率，背后正是本节&quot;凝结核&quot;与&quot;冰晶过程&quot;的应用。</li>\n<li>把本节的潜热概念记牢，它将在第三章解释温带气旋和强对流、在第四章解释水汽对气候的放大作用时再次出场。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>这一节的核心链条是：暖空气能装更多水汽（饱和水汽压随温度增大）→ 空气被抬升降温到饱和 → 多余水汽凝结成云，同时释放潜热使后续降温变慢（湿绝热递减率）。掌握饱和、露点、潜热、抬升凝结高度这几个概念，你就能解释云、雨、雾、迎风坡降水等一大批现象。到这里，大气的物质与能量基础就齐了——下一章我们让空气&quot;动起来&quot;，进入大气运动与动力学。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"水汽、饱和与云的形成","id":"水汽-饱和与云的形成"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"空气能\"装\"多少水","id":"空气能-装-多少水"},{"level":3,"text":"凝结放热：隐藏的燃料","id":"凝结放热-隐藏的燃料"},{"level":3,"text":"云为什么大多在抬升处出现","id":"云为什么大多在抬升处出现"},{"level":3,"text":"从云滴到降水","id":"从云滴到降水"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大气热力学与绝热过程","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science/atmosphere-composition-thermodynamics/atmospheric-thermodynamics"},"next":{"title":"作用在空气上的力与风的平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/atmospheric-science/atmospheric-motion-dynamics/forces-on-air-parcels"}}